BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kalymnos-vathy-panigiri-of-panagia-kyra-psili-vathy-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Kyra Psili\, Vathy
LOCATION:Vathy\, Kalymnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island's main Dormition feast is at the cliff monastery of Kyra Psili above the Vathy valley: pilgrims walk up in the evening of the 14th with mats and blankets\, the vigil starts around 9-10 pm\, and afterwards there is tsambouna-and-laouto music\, dancing and food stalls until morning. Wear proper shoes for the path and bring water\; cars stop well below the monastery.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kalymnos/#vathy-panigiri-of-panagia-kyra-psili-vathy
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kalymnos/#vathy-panigiri-of-panagia-kyra-psili-vathy
END:VEVENT
